desc(
	mode: "ssa"
	language: "bash"
	title: "Bash: shell debug tracing enabled"
	title_zh: "Bash：开启 Shell 调试跟踪"
	type: audit
	level: "low"
	rule_id: "bash-debug-trace"
	risk: "information-exposure"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 说明
`set -x`、`set -o xtrace` 或 `bash -x` 会把每一条展开后的命令写入 stderr。
命令中常见的令牌、口令、Cookie 和内部 URL 会因此进入日志、CI 输出或终端
录制中。攻击者也可能临时开启 trace 观察应用如何处理敏感变量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
生产环境关闭 xtrace。需要排障时使用最小范围、短时间的 trace，并在结束前
执行 `set +x`；不要把含密钥的命令放入 trace 范围，必要时通过 `set +x`
包裹敏感片段。
SOLUTION
	reference: <<<REFERENCE
[CWE-532](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/532.html)
REFERENCE
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.sh": <<<POS
set -x
set -o xtrace
bash -x deploy.sh
POS
	"safefile://neg.sh": <<<NEG
set -e
set -o pipefail
bash deploy.sh
NEG
)

set(* as $setArgs) as $setCall
$setCall?{any: /(^|[^A-Za-z0-9_])-x([^A-Za-z0-9_]|$)/, /xtrace/} as $setXtrace

/^(bash|sh|zsh|dash|ksh|ash)$/ as $shell
$shell(* as $shellArgs) as $shellCall
$shellCall?{any: /(^|[^A-Za-z0-9_])-x([^A-Za-z0-9_]|$)/, /xtrace/} as $shellXtrace

alert $setXtrace for {
	level: "low",
	title: "Bash: shell debug tracing enabled",
	title_zh: "Bash：开启 Shell 调试跟踪",
	message: "检测到 set -x/xtrace，展开后的命令和敏感参数会进入日志。",
	risk: "information-exposure",
}

alert $shellXtrace for {
	level: "low",
	title: "Bash: shell debug tracing enabled",
	title_zh: "Bash：开启 Shell 调试跟踪",
	message: "检测到以 -x 启动 Shell，命令参数会被完整打印。",
	risk: "information-exposure",
}
